{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:33 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"屯門大興邨49歲男子墮樓 當場死亡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c007a21a1d7c886cd51d1c1b5aac46a7/2026-10/02_6_27.jpg\"/>\n<p>屯門大興邨興輝樓，今日（10月19日）下午1時許，警方接獲途人報案，發現一名男子倒臥上址對開。警方到場證實男子已經死亡。經初步調查，相信男子49歲姓林，從上址住所墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，其尋死原因仍待調查。據悉，男子近日曾因生活問題不開心。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T11:39:39.338351+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:33:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:57.972342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T11:37:37.917840+00:00","content_hash":"3e1183684af936b473c845417391efee2720308cc926a0fa6314392a03679015","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}